window.products.push({"id":1130078,"name":"Polmedia Polish Pottery 12 oz Stoneware Bubble Mug H3111B Hand Painted from Ceramika Artystyczna in Boleslawiec Poland. Shape S115B(070) Pattern P0253","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pSYT6o0uL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This Polmedia Polish Pottery 12 oz Bubble Mug is made by Ceramika Artystyczna factory in Boleslawiec, Poland.Manufacturer shape number 070 (S115B), pattern number 50X (P0253A) Dimensions: 3¼\" wide, 4¾\" long, 3½\" high Capacity: 12oz Polmedia Polish Pottery Stoneware is: * Hand painted in Boleslawiec, Poland* Microwave safe, dishwasher safe, oven safe up to 480 F, freezer safe* Lead and cadmium free* Crack and chip resistant* Intended for everyday use, easy to clean* ProductID: H3111B, shape: 070 (S115B), pattern: 50X (P0253A) Features and Manufacturing Process Polmedia Polish pottery is created from white clay that is found only in the Boleslawiec region of Poland. The pottery is fired in coal and gas ovens at temperatures in excess of 2200 degrees Fahrenheit with a glaze that is lead and cadmium free. Polish pottery is known for it's versatility in that it is safe for use in the dishwasher, microwave, freezer and oven. Also, Polmedia Polish Pottery is resilient to abrasives making it durable and resistant to scratching or chipping. It is this combination of function and beauty that makes Polmedia Polish Pottery so appealing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pSYT6o0uL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Polmedia Polish Pottery","source_asin":"B009QP6YTG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1130078","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009QP6YTG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009QP6YTG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1130079,"name":"Corelle Impressions 20-Piece Dinnerware Set, Service for 4, Callaway","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":599.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Z7JVNAC8L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Corelle Impressions 20-Piece Set, Service for 4, includes 4-each10-1/4-inch Dinner Plates, 7-1/4-inch Salad/Dessert Plates, 18-ounceSoup/Cereal Bowls, 6-inch Saucers, 9-ounce-cups, Callaway Amazon.com Dressy enough for entertaining and durable enough for everyday use, this pretty dinnerware set from Corelle brings a little of the outdoors to the table. Imagine the dark green ivy climbing a classic brick building on the Oxford campus. That's the sort of charm wrought in the Callaway pattern. Coordinate this set with other pieces from the Callaway pattern, or let it stand on its own. With service for four, the 20-piece set includes four place settings, each with a 10-1/4-inch dinner plate, 7-1/8-inch salad or dessert plate, 18-ounce soup or cereal bowl, 6-inch saucer, and 9-ounce mug. The Callaway pattern features dark green rims, scalloped perimeters, and green ivy leaves and stems. Fear not about the colorful dyes used on the dishes. Corelle uses only food-safe enamel pigments and fires them directly onto the dinnerware. As a result, the colors won't fade, scrape, scratch, or wear off. Famous for its ultra durable, chip- and break-resistant dinnerware, Corelle thermally bonds three layers of glass together to produce unparalleled strength in its dishes. Because of this process, the dinnerware set is tough enough to use for reheating food in conventional, convection or microwave ovens. The set is also safe to use in the dishwasher and comes backed by Corelle Livingware's three-year warranty. --Betsy Herring What's in the Box 4 place settings. Each place setting consists of: 10-1/4-inch dinner plate; 7-1/8-inch salad/dessert plate; 18-ounce soup/cereal bowl; 6-inch saucer; 9-ounce mug. 20 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Z7JVNAC8L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Corelle","source_asin":"B0000CFT4U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1130079","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000CFT4U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000CFT4U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
