window.products.push({"id":1130197,"name":"GenMax Aerating Wine Pourer - in Bottle Wine Aerator & Decanter - Ergonomic Spout Tip - Larger Chamber for Better Aeration - Better Tasting Wine - Eas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51o8QOCzaIL._AC_.jpg","description":"Everybody Deserves A Glass Of Fine Tasting Wine. Even though that statement sounds so easy, sometimes it gets difficult to achieved; sometimes wines, due to the oxygen loss, lose of their taste and aromas. Don’t worry – here’s where our company comes in. It’s going to provide you with a top-notch aerator pourer that is going to make you love wine tasting again. Our one-of-a-bottle aerator, attaches to wine bottles thanks to the rubber, air-sealed ring. An aeration mechanism is also part of the whole product, which allows oxygen to enter your wine through an innovative and functional way. As soon as oxygen enters the wine, you’ll feel the bubbles in your mouth- that’s a good sign that the aeration process has been made the right way and that your wine’s quality will be upgraded soon. Premium Quality Is Our Middle Name. Constructed by durable materials that are never going to let you down, our splendid product has been built to last. The risk-free choice of materials makes that aerator perfect for safe use- enjoy a glass of wine without having a single care in this world. Avoid spillage and leaking thanks to the spout tip- pour your wine with accuracy and style! Everything A Wine Lover Needs. Alright- flowers or chocolates may be a good gift idea for common people, but a wine lover would definitely need something else. Our all-inclusive set does not only feature the aerator pourer, but a wine stopper as well; put a large smile on your friends’ face just like that! Do it the right way and appreciate the value of a fine tasting wine! Exclusively For Quality Lovers. Order Your Wine Aerator Pourer Today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51o8QOCzaIL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GenMax","source_asin":"B06ZZFXYJ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1130197","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06ZZFXYJ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06ZZFXYJ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
