window.products.push({"id":1130370,"name":"Aegean Concept Blanket, Handmade Vintage Boho Rustic 100% Cotton 3 Layers Super Soft 87x95 Inches, Adult Muslin Queen Sized Turkish Bedcover Bedspread","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91nxGvuJR0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍃 PACKAGE INCLUDES : The package contains one %100 organic cotton blanket queen size 95 inches x 87 inches. 🍃 SUPER SOFT FABRIC : Made from muslin natural cotton and no harmful chemicals and synthetic materials are added, which is safe for you and your family. Pure cotton has good moisture absorption and skin-friendly, makes people feel soft, comfortable and breathable. You will sleep like a baby as you lie down on the top of the set. 🍃 PRODUCT FEATURES: Our muslin blankets are made of three-layer yarn textile process. It is amazingly soft. Through the yarn-dyed process, colors are more real and will not fade or smells strange compared with printing. It adds mystery to your bedroom without losing the style of fashion and modernity. It will make your room look like it is from a magazine.Our muslin blankets will get softer and softer with each wash and you won't be how it is getting better and better on texture as you keep using it. 🍃 MULTIFUNCTIONAL USE: This reversible muslin blanket is not only soft and comfortable but also improves air circulation. Provides comfortable sleep for you and your family. Enjoy your time with our blankets as a travel blankets, toddler blankets, stroller covers, crib blankets, couch covers, sofa cover or just as a TV blankets to warm you up! 🍃 SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: Lifetime guarantee from Aegean Concept. You can return or replace it if you are not satisfied with the item you received within 15 days. If exceed 15 days, you can contact with Aegean Concept to work with you to solve the problem.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91nxGvuJR0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aegean Concept","source_asin":"B0BC283SB9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1130370","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BC283SB9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BC283SB9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
