window.products.push({"id":1130377,"name":"Copper Chef Perfect Pizza and Crisper Pan 15\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71puuBsgq8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Hate waiting for expensive pizza delivery that's cold and soggy by the time the doorbell rings? Now you can enjoy crispy, pizzeria perfect pizza right out of the oven with the Copper Chef 4-in-1 Perfect Pizza & Crisper Pan. It's the chef-grade, 15\" double sided non-stick pizza pan for evenly cooked, extra crisp bake at home pizza every single time. One side makes golden-brown thin crust pizza. Just flip it over for regular New York Style pizza crust or even ooey gooey cheesy stuffed crust! Use the Spring Form Wall with extra deep sides when you want an authentic, Chicago style deep dish pizza. The secret is 360&deg; Air Crisp Technology. It allows heat to circulate above, under, and around your pizza for a crispy golden crust every time. You can even use the Crisping Screen to turn your oven into an air fryer! Make crispy golden waffle fries, chicken wings, and more with no butter or oil required. You get your favorite fried food with less fat and fewer calories! The best part? It's the first pizza pan of its kind engineered with advanced Chef-Grade Non-Stick Coating. Nothing will stick to the pan! That means no scraping or scrubbing after dinner's over. And it's dishwasher safe, too. You get your favorite crisp pizza crust without delivery prices. Plus, mouthwatering fried food without butter or oil required. Without the kitchen disaster!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71puuBsgq8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Copper Chef","source_asin":"B073X15PDF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1130377","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073X15PDF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073X15PDF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1130378,"name":"Ballarini Bellamonte Cast Iron Dutch Oven with Lid 4.25-qt, Serves 3-4, Saggio Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717Q36PdESL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BALLARINI infuses the rich tradition of Italian cuisine into a contemporary line of enameled cast iron cookware, at an attractive price that makes them an ideal option for those just starting out with cast iron. Bellamonte Dutch ovens are also the perfect choice for the practiced home chef looking to expand their cast iron collection. Cook big batches for family and friends, then serve right to the table in these elegant Dutch ovens. The 4-quart Dutch oven is ideal for simmering hearty stews, and frying chicken on the stovetop without messy splatter, or baking bread and roasting veggies to tender perfection in the oven. Featuring a heavy, self-basting lid, food is always moist, tender, and full of flavor. Available in a variety colors inspired by Italian flavors, there’s a style that fits every kitchen aesthetic. Bellamonte enameled cast iron brings authentic Italian heritage to the modern kitchen. The elegant white cream interior possesses exceptional heat-retaining qualities, so the pot heats evenly throughout. The enamel coating is ultra-durable and scratch resistant so you can enjoy your cookware for longer. The exquisite brass-hued lid knob is adorned with the Rivarolo city gate, the iconic emblem of BALLARINI. Serve directly to the table in this stunning Dutch oven that features oversized handles for easy control and maximum maneuverability.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717Q36PdESL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BALLARINI","source_asin":"B0B9JHBX72","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1130378","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9JHBX72","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9JHBX72","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
