window.products.push({"id":1130402,"name":"Modern 50 Oz Clear Plastic Water Pitcher for Fridge [1 Pack]","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41czPLuAZFL._AC_SL1164_.jpg","description":"If you’re looking for a versatile, aesthetically-pleasing plastic carafe with lid, then you’re in the right place. As the head of my household, I'm always searching for ways to get more organized. One Sunday, while unloading groceries, I decided it was time to organize the refrigerator. I mainly needed smaller pitchers for the water, juice, and iced tea I had stored in there because they were clogging up a ton of space. So, I started hunting around for water pitchers that would help me get organized and add a sleek, modern touch to my home. I kept coming up empty. The plastic pitchers with lids that I found would either leak easily or have to be hand washed. I consider myself to be a problem-solver, so instead of beating my head against the wall trying to find the perfect pitcher, I decided to create one myself. That’s how Pitcher Perfect was born! I’m amazed how often I use this plastic water pitcher in my home, and I think it will be a wonderful addition to your home too; here’s why: Made from durable, food-grade plastic without BPA Ultra-clear, so you can quickly identify what's inside Includes a secure, spill-proof lid with a rubber stopper Very easy to clean in the dishwasher (won't warp or melt) Contoured neck makes it easy to hold onto & pour Modern, sleek design that fits nicely in the fridge door Perfect for a wide variety of cold beverages & liquids Click the “Add to Cart” button above to add this eye-catching, multi-use 50 ounce water pitcher into your home; you won’t regret it, guaranteed!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41czPLuAZFL._AC_SL1164_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pitcher Perfect","source_asin":"B09F5L7NTY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1130402","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09F5L7NTY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09F5L7NTY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
