window.products.push({"id":1130409,"name":"vctops Embroidered Lace Sofa Couch Cover, Quilted Sectional Couch Covers, Non-Slip Sofa Slipcover for Dogs Cats Pet Love Seat Recliner Leather L Shape","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ge1isflPL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"WHAT SIZE SHOULD I ORDER? Please MEASURE your furniture prior to purchasing. Each piece of furniture is unique and we want you to be thrilled with the fit. You can find a detailed size guide below: Sofa, Loveseat & Chair Size: 1. 28\" Width Series fits for sofa width equal or less than 24\". Refer to length, please add extra 4\" - 8\" longer than actual sofa length. 2. 36\" Width Series fits for sofa width between 24\" to 32\". Refer to length, please add extra 4\" - 8\" longer than actual sofa length. 3. 43\" Width Series fits for sofa width above 32\". Refer to length, please add extra 4\" - 8\" longer than actual sofa length. Armrest Size Reference: Two sizes for choice: 28\" x 28\", 36\" x 36\", please measure and choose suitable size to match. Backrest Size Reference: Backrest width below 32\", recommend folding the 28\" x 28\" rectangular cover to trianglular shape shown in the picture. Backrest width below 32\", recommend folding the 36\" x 36\" rectangular cover to trianglular shape shown in the picture. CAN I USE THIS ON LEATHER FURNITURE? Our slip-resistant protector works great on both fabric and leather furniture. However, because leather furniture does have a smoother surface, you may find that additional adjustments may be necessary.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ge1isflPL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"vctops","source_asin":"B09KGY4RXP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1130409","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KGY4RXP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KGY4RXP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1130410,"name":"LovePads 1.5mm Thick 42 x 60 Inches Floral Table Cover Protector, Table Protector for Dining Room Table, Plastic Tablecloth Protector, Table Pad for K","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81C3otDEN5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"vinyl PROTECTIVE: Thick and durable, heat resistance up to 176°F/80°C, protect your table, desk, tablecloth and furniture tops against from scratches, scuffs, stains, spillage etc. Works great on dining table, wooden table, glass, marble, stainless steel top, office desk, writing desktops, coffee & end table, TV bench, dresser and chest table, night stand, countertop, hard floor etc. EASY TO CLEAN - LovePads plastic table cover is waterproof and oil resistant. Most of stains can be easily wiped off with a damp cloth or washed with water, perfect to use on dining table. Please note that sauce stains and other dyeing materials should be cleaned up in time to prevent the dyestuff penetrate into the pad and cannot be removed over time. CUT TO FIT - This table pad may shrink, our factory has cut it slightly bigger in case of shrinkage, so it's not size problem when you don't get the exact measurement as advertised. And you can DIY the size and shape by yourself, firstly mark the outline with a pencil and a straight rule, then use a sharp knife or scissors to cut, it's easy. TEXTURED FINISH - The round table protector works great for all furniture tops, for example: wooden, glass or marble tables, hard floor etc. It comes with two different finishes, smooth and textured. When unroll it, please place textured finish on the table top. RISK-FREE PURCHASE - Buy with confidence! Your satisfaction is backed by our Risk-free 30 Day and 1 Year Warranty against any defects. Give it a chance, you will have a better life!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81C3otDEN5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LovePads","source_asin":"B07PLZ2YMM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1130410","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PLZ2YMM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PLZ2YMM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1130411,"name":"Southwestern Bedspread - Santa Clara KING","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519VOPs38xL._AC_.jpg","description":"This is a beautiful KING SIZE, woven southwestern bedspread with an outstanding southwest or western design. Using classic Native American Indian patterns for southwest decor, this colorful southwest bed spread design is woven, not printed, with soft durable acrylic. Beautiful and versatile, this southwest bedspread is reversible so it's like two spreads in one. It can be used as a lightweight blanket, as wells as a rustic furniture cover for a couch or chair. It is perfect for that special rustic cowboy, Indian or bunkhouse look and also great for cabin or lodge decor. Queen size is shown for display. Southwestern Bedspread Cleaning Tip: We recommend dry cleaning to be safe but many people wash the spreads in cold water, then tumble dry and remove them from the dryer early just before they are dry, leaving them slightly damp, then lay flat to air dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519VOPs38xL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mission Del Rey","source_asin":"B003L14PI8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1130411","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003L14PI8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003L14PI8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1130412,"name":"YEMYHOM 100% Cotton Weighted Blanket Adult Bed Heavy Blankets with Glass Beads (48\"x72\" 17 lbs, White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gQtv5pbQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Upgraded Design - Our weighted blanket will relax you by simulating the feeling of being held or hugged. YEMYHOM creative \"Honeycomb\" stitching design allows the glass beads to distribute evenly in individual pockets, rather than sticking or bunching in square corners, so as to fit for body curve more perfectly, you will feel more comfortably throughout the night SIZE & WEIGHT: 48\"x72\" 17lbs, Suitable for 150-190lbs individual. Please choose the blanket that weighs about 10% of your body weight + or - depending on individual preference. Recommend 48''x72'' for Twin size or Full size bed, 60''x80'' for Queen size or King size bed. YEMYHOM weighted bed blanket is designed to surround your body comfortably, so the idea blanket size don't exceed the size of the bed MATERIAL: Comfort is a key ingredient of the YEMYHOM weighted blankets. Our blanket is made of 100% Cotton fabric, breathable, comfortable and skin-friendly. 30% More beads are evenly distributed in each pockets and perfect adaption to our body. Super soft odorless fiberfill are filled inside to prevent movement and noise, provide soft and warmth while you're resting WELL-MADE: With 10 Years of textile production experience, YEMYHOM carry out the highest standards of quality control for the heavy blanket. Exquisite three-dimensional quilting and edging technology, prevent the leakage of glass beads, makes the weight blanket more durable. With strong corner loops, the blanket can be secured to your duvet cover firmly GIFT IDEA: Not only for sleeping at night, also for taking a nap, watching TV on couch. A MUST-HAVE blanket for everyone's bedroom that can be used in Spring, Summer, Autumn and Winter. This's a great Christmas gift, Valentines Day gift, Birthday gift for women or men, mum, dad, best friend, girlfriend, boyfriend. Get it for kids? Search \"YEMYHOM kids weighted blanket\" on Amazon to get 5-10lbs children blankets","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gQtv5pbQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YEMYHOM","source_asin":"B07RQRMKVP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1130412","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RQRMKVP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RQRMKVP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
