window.products.push({"id":1130505,"name":"Blank 12-Egg View Style Paper Pulp Carton - 50 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ivakRe1HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☑️ MATERIAL: Strong & thick sustainable paper-pulp material keeps your eggs safe and secure. Jumbo cell size. Holds 12 (one dozen) Jumbo Cell Size (holds Jumbo and oversized chicken eggs and most small duck eggs; approximately 63-70g). These cartons are made from 100% recycled materials. They are recyclable, biodegradable, and compostable! ☑️ CUSTOMIZABLE: Blank egg carton with no printing, text, or imagery allows you to personalize your egg carton with a custom label or sticker featuring farm name, info, and more! ☑️ BULK EGG CARTONS: These come in a value pack of 50 egg cartons, perfect for small backyard chicken & duck farmers who gift their farm fresh eggs to friends and family, or to sell to multiple customers! ☑️MULTIPLE USES: These rustic egg cartons work great as unique packaging for small businesses selling things like bath bombs, baked goods, and more. Also function well as storage for small pieces like auto parts or sewing materials. Eco-friendly recycled paper material means that these cartons can be used as seed starters, planted straight into the ground!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ivakRe1HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Egg Carton","source_asin":"B092JSMCT2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1130505","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092JSMCT2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092JSMCT2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1130506,"name":"Portable Computer Office Desk, Couch Laptop Table Adjustable Overbed Sofa Table // Littay","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61df11EPakL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"The computer desk and related ergonomic desk are furniture pieces designed to comfortably and aesthetically provide a working surface and house or conceal office equipment including computers, peripherals and cabling for office and home-office users. The ergonomic desk is a modern desk form which, like the adjustable drawing table or drafting table, offers mechanical adjustments for the placement of its elements in order to maximize user comfort and efficiency. The ergonomic desk is usually a \"stand-alone\" piece of furniture allowing access to the adjustment mechanisms.  Some ergonomic desks have a sufficiently large desktop height adjustment to create either a common \"sit-down\" desk or a less common standing desk, which allows the user to work while standing. The ergonomic desk is usually a close companion to the ergonomic chair. The ergonomic desk originated with the beginning of the field of human factors or ergonomics after World War II. Legislation stating minimal requirements for furniture used by office workers referred to ergonomic desk standards. The most common form of the computer desk is a variant of the ergonomic desk, which has an adjustable keyboard tray and sufficient desktop space for handwriting. Provisions for a monitor shelf and holes for routing cables are integrated in the design, making it easier to connect the computer components together. The typical armoire desk provides space for a keyboard, mouse, monitor, printer and speakers. Cubicle desk designs for business and government workplaces include a range of shelves, trays and cable-routing holes for computer systems. In some computer desks, the cabling is affixed to the modesty panel at the back of the desk, to create a neater appearance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61df11EPakL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Littay","source_asin":"B07T8NRTQH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1130506","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07T8NRTQH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07T8NRTQH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
