window.products.push({"id":1130606,"name":"Tronco 20 OZ Glass Tumbler with Straw,Gift for Women/Mom,Glass Tumbler With Silicone Sleeve Straw,Wide Mouth Water Bottle Iced Coffee Cup-BPA free","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zoNcDOdpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The tronco glass water bottle is the healthy way to stay hydrated everywhere. Made from high quality, shatter-resistant glass, with an easy grip protective sleeve and safe Polypropylene lid, it’s perfectly designed to fit into your bag, your cup holder, and your life. Beautifully designed and artfully crafted for BPA free hydration on the go , the tronco glass water bottle is lightweight and durable, holds 20 oz. and features a soft silicone sleeve that won’t peel, fade or melt in the dishwasher. It’s made to be sustainable from the top down! The silicone flip top seals when plugged but is not upside-down, bottom-of-the-bag leakproof and made from a renewable resource that’s naturally devoid of BPA phthalates and other chemical contaminants. The smooth, wide mouth design delivers a comfortable drinking experience for adults and children alike. MATERIALSBOTTLE: BPA-free, 100% glassSLEEVE: Soft chemically inert, non-toxic siliconeLID: Bamboo LidDIMENSIONS & CAPACITYVOLUME: 20 ozWIDTH2.6 inchesFits in most standard drink holdersCARE: Hand-wash with warm, soapy water or wash on the top-rack of your dishwasher. Do not remove the sleeve. Store with the cap off. Cap: Hand-wash only. Do not place in the dishwasher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zoNcDOdpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"tronco","source_asin":"B08KPBL874","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1130606","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KPBL874","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KPBL874","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
