window.products.push({"id":1130641,"name":"EXP Handmade Oriental Furniture 27-Inch Antique Style Black End Table with Nature Motifs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kEsYP1q4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"A delectably detailed home accent piece, this inspired Asian end table will infuse your decor with the timeless mystery of the East. Handcrafted by master artisans in China's Guangdong province, this accent piece features dreamy butterflies hand-painted in stunning hues of green, gold, red and black, framed by delicate gold latticework. In Chinese tradition, butterflies are symbolic of marital devotion and happiness. On each side is a dramatic and detailed rendering of peonies, orchids and narcissus in full bloom. The upper two drawers pull open to reveal the perfect place for safekeeping small personal treasures while below, a pair of doors swing open for access to a generous interior storage space, containing one shelf with 6 inches of space above and below. Antiqued iron drawer pulls and a pin latch finish this masterful creation with a tasteful flourish. Both a work of art and a practical home furnishing, this atmospheric Oriental creation is sure to be a treasured addition to your decor. Measures 27 inches high x 20 inches wide x 14 inches long. Experience the world from the comfort of home when you shop with AsiaEXP, bringing you a wide range of handmade creations from a variety of world cultures. By shopping with us you not only receive a unique and authentic handicraft, but also help to sustain local artisans and longstanding creative traditions of East Asia. The handcrafted nature of this item will produce slight variations from piece to piece in color, form and sizing, adding to the unique quality of individual items. All measurements are approximate.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kEsYP1q4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EXP","source_asin":"B001KWGJAM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1130641","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001KWGJAM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001KWGJAM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1130642,"name":"Swarovski Crystal \" Owlet\" Figurine New 2018","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Cg5EZcYNL._AC_SL1440_.jpg","description":"Find inspiration in the natural world with this cute owlet. It is crafted in faceted clear crystal with yellow and black eyes. This symbol of wisdom and intelligence is perched on a crystal branch. An ideal gift for bird lovers and collectors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Cg5EZcYNL._AC_SL1440_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SWAROVSKI","source_asin":"B078J5JR3K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1130642","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078J5JR3K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078J5JR3K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1130643,"name":"Pluto Produkter Gold Star Rotary Candleholder","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gx7uLLowL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When the included tea light candle is lit in the base of the rotary candle holder, the heat of the candle will make the gold stars and the carousel spin, and shaped reflections move around the ceiling. Comes nicely presented in a box ideal as a gift. Remarkably sophisticated with just a touch of whimsy, this gold star candle holder is a wonderful way to bring smiles with a unique display of entertainment in motion! Each of our stunning rotary candle holders is crafted from durable metal with a beautiful gold finish. Just position the flickering tea light candle (included), and within moments the heat from the flame will set the art in motion. You can add your own scented tea light and indulge in your favorite aroma. These Änglaspel are designed in and imported from Sweden. They are contemporary versions of the traditional candle chimes. Because these were designed to actually rotate and cast beautiful shadows, the metal is thin, and the item light-weight. Some of the competing rotary candleholders you will see have less detail (especially in shadow), and 4 clappers rather than 6. When you see the Pluto Produkter AB as the manufacturer and PlutoGifts as the merchant, you can be confident of high quality and wonderful attention to detail. In order to see the hundred different choices from Pluto Produkter AB just type \"rotary candleholder\" in the search box above. For those of us who grew up with them, rotary candle holders are a seasonal blend of light and motion. They belong to a purely domestic and old-fashioned type of joy, one that emphasizes a dark room over a brightly lit one (to appreciate the dancing interplay of light and shadow); and calm over activity (so that stray air currents shouldn’t disrupt the workings). Darkness, stillness, silence: all inescapable aspects of the northern winter, and it is therefore not surprising that candle holders are such an enduring tradition.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gx7uLLowL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pluto Produkter","source_asin":"B014WY7P98","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1130643","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014WY7P98","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B014WY7P98","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
