window.products.push({"id":1130729,"name":"Lifetime Commercial Rectangular Folding Table (4 Pack), 8', Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":849.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DWG2KJEcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Lifetime's new line of premium Black & silver office furniture. Our 8-Foot commercial folding tables are constructed of high-density polyethylene & are stronger, lighter & more durable than wood tables. The innovative nesting design lets multiple table stack together for space saving storage. Our tables are UV-protected with all-weather construction for both indoor & outdoor use. The patented steel frame design provides a sturdy foundation & is protected with a powder-coated, weather-resistant finish. Our high strength low alloy (HSLA) steel creates a lighter table with increased strength & stability. Built for the rigors of heavy-duty commercial use, lifetime folding tables exceed challenging BIFMA standards & are backed by a ten-year warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DWG2KJEcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIFETIME","source_asin":"B016BJDYQA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1130729","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B016BJDYQA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B016BJDYQA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1130730,"name":"Ultra Soft Weighted Blanket Cover | Plush Velvet Removable Cover | Fits 60\"x80\" Weighted Blanket (Duvet Cover only)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81p1de0YP3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"**This item is a Duvet Cover for a Weighted Blanket – The Blanket is sold separately**  WE ARE WEIGHTED BLANKET NERDS! We spent thousands of hours researching, analyzing competitor products, designing, then tweaking the design, and ultimately creating our line of Premium Weighted Blankets and Covers. Just because most blankets & duvet covers look the same, does not mean they are of the same quality. We found most blankets on the market today suffer from the same problems – weak stitching, blanket weight that shifts and does not stay in place, low quality fabric (our blankets are 400 thread count) and worst of all – internal pellets becoming lose and getting all over your bed.  Premium Weighted Blankets by HomeSmart Products solves all of these problems by using a stitching strength that is above industry standard, ultra-soft fabric with the highest thread count blanket on the market, as well as, carefully placed and engineered squares sowed into the blanket. The result is a blanket that will exceed your expectations!  Utilizing only the force of gravity to settle and hold the weighted blanket snugly in place, your body will be enveloped by a soothing sensation of pressure. Often, it is recommended to select a blanket weight that is 10% of your body weight, however, we have found that the right weight varies by individual, depending on how much pressure is desired. For this reason, we offer blankets ranging from 10lbs to 30lbs.  If you are shopping for an older child, it is advised to select a blanket weight and size that will allow for future use. This will also allow you to protect your investment for many years to come.  Our blankets have helped many people achieve a relaxed state, allowing them to sleep more deeply. Keeping our customers happy means we get to continue to bring amazing products to the world. YOUR HAPPINESS IS OUR MISSION!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81p1de0YP3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HomeSmart Products","source_asin":"B07MBJCTH8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1130730","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MBJCTH8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MBJCTH8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
