window.products.push({"id":1130764,"name":"Queen Soft Side Water Bed Mattress with Bamboo Cover and 95% Waveless Bladder","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":899.71,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ctmY5L7UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This softside waterbed mattress is very popular for many reasons. To start with the quilted smooth top cover is soft and very breathable. This cover is not thick or plush like a pillow top and its perfect for the person who wants to sleep closer to the water bladder along with a nice breathable surface between them and the water bladder. The Bamboo zipper cover also unzips completely off from the bottom for easy maintenance. This mattress is a deep fill with a 7\" cavity so you will get that traditional waterbed feel like you would expect. The waterbed bladder is a 95% Waveless with about 3-4 seconds of slow movement. The water bladder has 6 layers of contour fiber running from head to foot & extra fiber in the mid section which will help keep your body more level and very comfortable. All the fiber is tethered together to help prevent shifting and sliding. This softside mattress includes an adjustable digital heating system The waterbed heater is easy to use and it will keep your mattress warm on those cold winter nights. This mattress also includes a deep fill foam perimeter which is tethered together to help prevent stretching from the weight of the water. This complete soft side mattress needs to be placed on a strong flat surface. If you need a base we also sell this same exact soft sided mattress along with a base here on amazon. If you been looking to replace your old softside mattress then this is the best time to do so when the price is so right. Also to all the people who may have switched their waterbed out for another type bed over the years and have regretted it ever since. Now is the time to get a waterbed back into your life today and start sleeping and resting better every night like you should. Also keep in mind you most likely spend 30 to 40 percent of your life in bed so choose the best one for you. If you have any questions feel free to ask any time. Thank-you for looking at our products. Mattress Covers Amazon Store","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ctmY5L7UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"United States Water Mattress","source_asin":"B07JPY2FVH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1130764","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JPY2FVH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JPY2FVH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
