window.products.push({"id":1130897,"name":"Corelle Vitrelle Coordinates 2-Qt Serving Bowl 2-Pack, Large Serving Plates, Triple Layer Glass, Crack and Chip Resistant, Oval Serving Trays, Portofi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FumJzNB3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Seaside towns on the Italian coast inspired this intricate pattern in classic shades of blue. Filled with side dishes for the family, these serving bowls are great for everyday meals and more formal entertaining. They pair beautifully with our Portofino dinnerware, but work equally well with solid white plates.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FumJzNB3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Corelle","source_asin":"B0C1VT4HPS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1130897","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1VT4HPS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1VT4HPS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1130898,"name":"Dirt Devil MBV2030BTR Rechargeable Broom Vacuum, Butter Yellow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/2110j6ukdQL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Lightweight and Convenient to complete the chore like a charm. Sweep and Vacuum in one simple step with this bagless Dirt Devil Broom Vac¿Weighing less than 5 lbs, it lightweight design gives your aching back a break but it is not light on Power. Amazon.com An inexpensive alternative to brooms, dustpans, and bending over to get at the last of the dirt pile, the cordless, bagless, yet surprisingly effective Dirt Devil Broom Vacuum is well suited to heavy-duty sweeping and vacuuming on hard-surface floors of all types. Where it really shines, though, is for quick touch-ups--the dog-hair tumbleweeds and stray Cheerios of everyday life. 60% more powerful than the Broom Vacuum's last incarnation, its 9.6 volt motor has plenty of juice for sucking up debris from tile, laminate, hardwoods, and linoleum. Users with bad backs will appreciate the foot-activated on/off switch, and at just 3-1/2 pounds, without cumbersome power cords to trip over, the unit maneuvers with admirable ease. It's easy to see when the transparent dirt cup is full, and the canister snaps off easily for emptying. Brushed-edge cleaning extends the unit's reach, and the 10-inch-wide nozzle feels more like a broom than a skinny stick vacuum. To recharge, simply plug into the included adaptor when storing. The Dirt Devil Broom Vacuum is not intended for wet spills or carpeted surfaces, but for dry messes, crumbs, and dust, it's a solid value and so easy to use that you just might find yourself sweeping the kitchen floor more often. The unit measures a compact 21 by 13 by 1-1/2 inches and is covered by a one-year warranty. --Mary Park","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/2110j6ukdQL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dirt Devil","source_asin":"B000U6HZ98","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1130898","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000U6HZ98","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000U6HZ98","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
