window.products.push({"id":1130953,"name":"25QT/24L Air Fryer Oven, 12-IN-1 Air Fryer Oven Combo, Large Capacity Convection Toaster Oven for Family Meal, 12 Cooking Presets, LCD Touchscreen, No","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HDWB6kjPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥩25QT Large Capacity, Quick Family Meals🥩: Extra-large 25-quart capacity fits a whole 5lbs rotisserie chicken, bakes a 12” pizza, or 6 slices of bread. The air fryer toaster oven countertop is perfectly fit for a whole family meal size. Make 2 sheet pan meals at once for entertaining or weekly meal prep. 1740W fast heating cooking up to 30% faster than a traditional convection oven, varying temperature evenly from 45-450℉. 🥑12 Versatile Functions, Healthy & Less Fat Cooking🥑: Air Fry, toast, bake, convect, broil, wings, defrost, dehydrate, fries, pizza, keep warm, veggies, all in this multi-functional 1740-watt toaster oven air fryer combo. Cook your favorite foods easily, and deliver you the extra-crispy fried texture and flavor of deep-fried foods but up to 70% fewer calories from fat 🥩Intuitive Operation Screen, Easy to Use🥩: The Large LCD screen display cooking information, such as temperature and cooking countdown time. Each program has set the temperature and time. Easy to use with just rotating the control knob. The top handle allows you to open the door with a single hand effortlessly. 🥑Compact Size & Superb Design🥑: The convection toaster oven measure size 14.5''×15.7''×13.3'', which takes less space. The visual window and interior light allow you to easily monitor your meals. The premium full stainless steel is more durable, and also makes your kitchen modern. The heat-resistant door and cool-to-the-touch handle minimize the risk of accidental burns as well. The large-capacity air fryer toaster oven features non-stick parts, and each of these parts is dishwasher-safe. 🥩Multiple Accessories & Easy Clean-up🥩: The whole air fryer toaster oven set includes a 1×baking pan, 1×oven rack, 1×drip pan, 1×air fry basket, 1×removable crumb tray, which are removable dishwasher-safe and make cleaning a breeze. A simple soapy wipe-down will suffice to clean the outside of your air fryer. Grill all year long, and the cleanup is a breeze. Nothing sticks to it!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HDWB6kjPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LyriFine","source_asin":"B0B51HRTLV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1130953","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B51HRTLV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B51HRTLV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
