window.products.push({"id":1130974,"name":"Pendleton Twin Wool Camp Blanket with Leather Carrier - Mineral Umber","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":229.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71G08n4C1cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"\"The Pendleton Yakima Mineral Umber Camp Blanket has a vintage style that is at home in both rustic and contemporary settings. The original camp blankets were relied on by early sheep herders to meet the rigorous demands of the wild, untamed Pacific Northwest. Rugged and warm, this blanket is an outstanding quality blanket that will provide years of warmth and comfort. Khaki brown. 86% wool/14% cotton. Twin: 66\" x 84\". Made in the USA. The original camp blankets were a staple among early sheep herders to warm them against the cold, wet seasons in the wild. These ruggedly styled, heavy-duty blankets offer outstanding warmth. They are tough enough for everything from outdoor camping to sleeping on your back porch, and are reliable blankets that will last for decades. Whipstich binding.\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71G08n4C1cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pendleton","source_asin":"B00FQIHLXK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1130974","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FQIHLXK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FQIHLXK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
