window.products.push({"id":1130981,"name":"Homaxy Velvet Dining Room Chair Seat Cover, Washable Removable Soft Chair Seat Cushion Protector Slipcovers with Ties - Set of 4, Coffee","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lq8x4dGEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Material: 92% Polyester, 8% Spandex Velvet Fabric. Modern and simple design: Solid color anti-wrinkle elastic chair seat cover give your chair a new look, suitable for four seasons. Multi occasions: Spandex stretch velvet chair seat covers can be used for dining room, kitchen, office, hotel, coffee shops, restaurant and home decoration ect. Excellent elasticity: Spandex velvet chair seat covers are made of stretchable material, recovers quickly, secure fit with sewn-in elastic hem, give a good protect and decoration for your chairs. Measuring Tips We recommended you following our measuring guide to measure your chair seat size before buy the items so that it can fit your chairs perfectly. Chair seat cover size: Length: between 14” to 20” Width: between 14” to 20” Thickness: between 1.5'' to 3'' Installation Steps: 1. Remove the seat cushion from your chair. 2. Slip on the seat cover to the seat cushion. 3. Stretch it to better cover the cushion and flat its surface. 4. Turn the cushion cover and tighten drawstrings. 5. Re-install the covered cushion on the cover. Please Note: 1. Please allow 0.5-1 inch error due to manual measurement. please check the size chart carefully before you buy the item. 2. All pictures in-kind shooting, but due to the shooting light, angle and color displays, physical and photos’ color maybe some slight differences. 100% Refund Guarantee : We offer 100% no risk money-back guarantee if you're dissatisfied with your purchase for any reason. Please contact with us, we will provide help within 24 hours and do our best to give you the most satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lq8x4dGEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homaxy","source_asin":"B07TXPMS6D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1130981","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TXPMS6D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TXPMS6D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
