window.products.push({"id":1130992,"name":"Makemyth Rectangular Conference Folding Table (S, White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PcDRpmvbL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Makemyth is a registered trademark by american company. It is a protected brand under Amazon policy. SMALL: 31.5\"W x 63\"L x 29.5\"H MEDIUM: 39.5\"W x 79\"L x 29.5\"H LARGE: 47.25\"W x 94.5\"L x 29.5\"H Description: The sophisticated folding technique of the folding table and the large lockable wheels, as well as the elegant design and high-quality materials, are equally responsible for the table’s success. The table’s structure makes it simple to use and transport. Dynamic. Space-saving. Superbly designed.Desk-sharing, flexible teamwork and short-term integration of freelancers into project groups have become an integral part of our daily work routine. That means it is high time for this to be reflected in the working environment too.That is why we have developed a conference table that can accommodate both individual persons or a group of eight. That can be folded up in no time at all and rolled to the side of the room. Everyone can therefore be as creative as the environment allows. The Makemyth folding table provides you with optimal conditions for free personal development.Thanks to Makemyth folding tables,versatile usage of well-designed conference and meeting areas is child’s play.Only one single person is required to set up and rearrange the movable folding tables – without any tools, releasing or unlocking procedures or special skills involved. If partitions are used to divide up rooms, conference or project work tables can be transformed into a large conference layout in no time. It is a welcoming thought that investing in Makemyth folding tables pays for itself so quickly. Each package includes two parts, one is the tabletop, another is the bracket. You need to assemble them together. 90% is already assembled. So take it easy. Better use a Magnetic screwdriver to install it","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PcDRpmvbL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MAKEMYTH","source_asin":"B072F7K9QD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1130992","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072F7K9QD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072F7K9QD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
